    (numerical drift), NOT cause (d) (BLAS thread nondeterminism).
    Root cause investigation needed: likely data-ordering difference or
    sparse-category handling (R: 36654 bounds-violated, Py: 36775 —
    small but nonzero discrepancy in detected violations).
